{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-offset-credit-claim","title":"碳抵消与碳信用声明规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/carbon-offset-credit-claim","wordCount":1959,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"碳抵消与碳信用声明规范\">碳抵消与碳信用声明规范</h1><p>当减排减不动的时候，企业自然会想到买碳信用来&quot;抵消&quot;。这个念头在 2020 年代初还属于可以公开宣传的做法，到 2026 年已经变成一条法律红线：欧盟已经将基于碳抵消的&quot;碳中和&quot;声明纳入禁止范围，科学碳目标体系明确不接受用抵消充当减排。这一篇讲清碳信用的质量分级、声明的允许边界，以及工程上怎么把&quot;减排量&quot;与&quot;抵消量&quot;分开记账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>碳信用（carbon credit）是一吨二氧化碳当量减排量或移除量的可交易凭证。它的质量由三件事决定：<strong>额外性</strong>（这个减排量在没有碳信用收入时会不会发生）、<strong>永久性</strong>（这个减排量会不会被逆转）、<strong>无重复计算</strong>（同一吨有没有被两个主体各记一次）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[碳信用质量] --&gt; B[额外性]&#10;  A --&gt; C[永久性]&#10;  A --&gt; D[无重复计算]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[基准线设定合理]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[存在障碍需要信用收入突破]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[逆转风险识别]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[缓冲池或补偿机制]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[双重签发]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[双重声明]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[双重使用]&#10;  A --&gt; E[ICVCM 核心碳原则]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[治理: 治理/追踪/透明/独立核验]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[减排影响: 额外性/永久性/量化/无重复]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[可持续发展: 保障/净零转型贡献]\">graph TD\n  A[碳信用质量] --&gt; B[额外性]\n  A --&gt; C[永久性]\n  A --&gt; D[无重复计算]\n  B --&gt; B1[基准线设定合理]\n  B --&gt; B2[存在障碍需要信用收入突破]\n  C --&gt; C1[逆转风险识别]\n  C --&gt; C2[缓冲池或补偿机制]\n  D --&gt; D1[双重签发]\n  D --&gt; D2[双重声明]\n  D --&gt; D3[双重使用]\n  A --&gt; E[ICVCM 核心碳原则]\n  E --&gt; E1[治理: 治理/追踪/透明/独立核验]\n  E --&gt; E2[减排影响: 额外性/永久性/量化/无重复]\n  E --&gt; E3[可持续发展: 保障/净零转型贡献]</pre><p>最被广泛引用的质量基准是自愿碳市场诚信委员会（ICVCM）的核心碳原则（Core Carbon Principles, CCPs），共十条，分三组：治理组（有效治理、追踪、透明、稳健的独立第三方核验）、减排影响组（额外性、永久性、稳健量化、无重复计算）、可持续发展组（可持续发展效益与保障、对净零转型的贡献）（<a href=\"https://icvcm.org/core-carbon-principles/\">ICVCM 核心碳原则</a>）。这套原则的作用是给&quot;这个信用算不算数&quot;提供一个可判定的框架——只有当信用的签发程序与类别都通过了 CCP 评估，它才被允许打上 CCP 标签。</p>\n<p>注册与签发层面最主流的是 Verra 的核证碳标准（VCS），它签发的核证碳单位（VCU）每一单位代表一吨二氧化碳当量的减排或移除量。项目必须遵循 VCS 标准、使用经批准的方法学、由独立的第三方核证机构完成审定与核证、经过 30 天公示期，并在公开注册表中登记（<a href=\"https://verra.org/programs/verified-carbon-standard/\">Verra VCS</a>）。这段要求里的每个环节都对应一个工程上可验证的字段：注册表编号、方法学编号、核证机构、公示期起止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"减排与抵消必须分开记账\">减排与抵消必须分开记账</h2><h3 id=\"只有移除类才能中和残余排放\">只有移除类才能中和残余排放</h3><p>碳管理里最容易做错、也最容易被审计抓住的一件事，是把购买碳信用记成减排量。正确的做法是<strong>两条独立的账</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>企业碳排放</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(不减任何抵消)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{企业碳排放} = E_{\\text{gross}} \\quad \\text{(不减任何抵消)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">企业碳排放</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不减任何抵消</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净排放披露</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>removal</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>removal</mtext></msub><mtext>仅限永久性移除</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净排放披露} = E_{\\text{gross}} - R_{\\text{removal}} \\quad (R_{\\text{removal}} \\text{仅限永久性移除})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净排放披露</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">removal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">removal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仅限永久性移除</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>抵消量单独披露</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(不计入减排进展)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{抵消量单独披露} = C_{\\text{credit}} \\quad \\text{(不计入减排进展)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抵消量单独披露</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不计入减排进展</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{gross}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是总排放，减排进展只由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{gross}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的下降来体现；碳信用只能作为&quot;抵消量&quot;单独披露，且其中只有永久性移除类才能用于中和残余排放，并且通常有比例上限。SBTi 的标准就是这套逻辑的明确表述：至少 90% 的排放在价值链内减排，剩余不超过 10% 用永久性移除中和，抵消不能算作减排（<a href=\"https://files.sciencebasedtargets.org/production/files/Net-Zero-Standard.pdf\">SBTi 企业净零标准</a>）。</p>\n<p>落到数据模型上，这意味着<strong>碳信用的购买记录不能与减排项目的实施记录放在同一张表里</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 减排记在活动数据的变化上，抵消单独一表&#10;CREATE TABLE offset_credit_retirement (&#10;  retirement_id     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  registry          TEXT NOT NULL,       -- verra_vcs / gold_standard / ...&#10;  registry_serial   TEXT NOT NULL,       -- 注册表序列号，唯一&#10;  category          TEXT NOT NULL,       -- reduction / removal_biological&#10;                                         -- / removal_geological&#10;  is_ccp_labeled    BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  vvb_ref           TEXT NOT NULL,       -- 核证机构&#10;  methodology_ref   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  vintage_year      INT NOT NULL,&#10;  retired_on        DATE NOT NULL,       -- 注销日期(同一信用不得再用)&#10;  tonnes_co2e       NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL CHECK (tonnes_co2e &gt; 0),&#10;  UNIQUE (registry, registry_serial)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 报表约束: 只有 removal_geological 且 ccp 的信用可计入&quot;中和残余排放&quot;&#10;CREATE VIEW neutralization_eligible AS&#10;SELECT registry, registry_serial, tonnes_co2e, vintage_year&#10;FROM offset_credit_retirement&#10;WHERE category = &#39;removal_geological&#39;&#10;  AND is_ccp_labeled&#10;  AND retired_on &gt;= DATE &#39;2026-01-01&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 减排记在活动数据的变化上，抵消单独一表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> offset_credit_retirement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retirement_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  registry          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- verra_vcs / gold_standard / ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  registry_serial   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注册表序列号，唯一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- reduction / removal_biological</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                         -- / removal_geological</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_ccp_labeled    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vvb_ref           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 核证机构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  methodology_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vintage_year      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retired_on        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注销日期(同一信用不得再用)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tonnes_co2e       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tonnes_co2e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (registry, registry_serial)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 报表约束: 只有 removal_geological 且 ccp 的信用可计入\"中和残余排放\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> neutralization_eligible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry, registry_serial, tonnes_co2e, vintage_year</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offset_credit_retirement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'removal_geological'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_ccp_labeled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retired_on </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条设计要点。第一，<code>UNIQUE (registry, registry_serial)</code> 是<strong>防止双重使用的第一道防线</strong>——同一张信用被注销两次在物理上不可能，数据库层面也不该允许。第二，把 <code>category</code> 拆成移除类与减排类，因为只有移除类才可能计入中和，减排类信用在净零框架里不能用于中和残余排放。第三，<code>is_ccp_labeled</code> 作为布尔字段，让报表能立刻区分&quot;贴了 CCP 标签的信用&quot;与&quot;未评估信用&quot;，这在对外披露时是必须区分的口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声明的允许边界\">声明的允许边界</h2><h3 id=\"声明模板应作为可配置项\">声明模板应作为可配置项</h3><p>把碳信用用进对外声明时，有明确的禁止清单。欧盟《赋能消费者绿色转型指令》（Directive (EU) 2024/825）修订了《不公平商业行为指令》，将基于碳抵消的&quot;碳中和&quot;声明纳入禁止范围，并收紧了对通用环境声明与可持续性标签的要求（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/circular-economy/green-claims_en\">欧盟委员会绿色声明</a>）。《绿色声明指令》提案进一步要求显式环境声明必须用科学、可核验的方法支撑，并由独立且获得认可的核验方检查，其方法学与欧盟环境足迹方法对齐。</p>\n<p>从碳信托（Carbon Trust）碳足迹标签体系在 2023 年 9 月撤回&quot;碳中和&quot;声明类别这一动作，可以看出行业实践的变化方向（<a href=\"https://www.carbontrust.com/what-we-do/assurance-and-certification/product-carbon-footprint-label\">Carbon Trust 产品碳足迹标签</a>）。它保留了&quot;减量 + 气候项目&quot;这类声明——即减排声明加上资助碳项目——而不是把资助碳项目包装成中和。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>声明</th>\n<th>2026 年状态</th>\n<th>必须满足的条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;本产品碳中和&quot;（基于买信用）</td>\n<td>多法域禁止</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;本产品碳足迹 X kgCO₂e，较基准年下降 Y%&quot;</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>基准年、可比方法、核验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;本产品剩余排放由永久性移除中和&quot;</td>\n<td>有限允许</td>\n<td>仅移除类、有比例上限、单独披露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;本企业资助了 Z 吨碳减排项目&quot;</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>不得与自有减排量混算，须标注为资助而非减排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;净零排放&quot;</td>\n<td>严格受限</td>\n<td>需 90% 价值链减排 + 永久移除中和残余</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的工程含义是：<strong>声明模板要作为配置而不是硬编码文案</strong>，因为规则在变。每一条声明模板绑定一组前置条件（用哪个口径的数字、核验状态、信用的类别与标签、比例上限），当规则收紧时改配置，不改代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆向逻辑-先问该不该抵消\">逆向逻辑：先问该不该抵消</h2><h3 id=\"四步判定顺序\">四步判定顺序</h3><p>在工程上做碳信用管理之前，有一个更重要的判断：<strong>这批残余排放是否真的不可减</strong>。多数声称&quot;减不动&quot;的场景，其实是第四章第一篇里的杠杆还没做完——装载率还有空间、包材还能减重、模式还能分层。碳抵消之所以有诱惑力，是因为它便宜且不需要改变任何业务决策。</p>\n<p>一个可执行的判定顺序是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>把那批残余排放对应到生命周期阶段（用第 1 章的阶段拆分）。</li>\n<li>对每个阶段跑一遍 <a href=\"../../emission-reduce-offset/fulfillment-decarbon-lever\">履约减排杠杆</a> 的 MAC 排序。</li>\n<li>只对 MAC 为正且高于当前碳价的残余排放，才进入抵消评估。</li>\n<li>抵消评估里先筛类别（移除 ≥ 减排）再筛标签（CCP）再筛年份。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个顺序的价值不在于它多聪明，而在于它<strong>把抵消放在了最后而不是最前</strong>。绝大多数碳管理项目失败的原因，是把抵消当成了起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>碳信用质量由额外性、永久性、无重复计算三者决定；ICVCM 的十项核心碳原则提供了可判定的评估框架。</li>\n<li>减排量与抵消量必须分账；减排进展只由总排放下降体现，抵消单独披露。</li>\n<li>只有永久性移除类信用可能用于中和残余排放，且有比例上限；减排类信用不能用于中和。</li>\n<li>注册表序列号唯一约束是防止双重使用的第一道数据库防线。</li>\n<li>&quot;碳中和&quot;基于抵消的声明在多法域已禁止；声明模板应作为可配置项，随规则变化调整。</li>\n<li>抵消是最后手段：先用 MAC 排序把可减的减掉，只对减不动的残余排放做抵消评估。</li>\n<li>这些数字最终要经得起第三方核查，见 <a href=\"../../emission-reduce-offset/carbon-footprint-audit-verify\">碳足迹核算核查与审计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碳抵消与碳信用声明规范","id":"碳抵消与碳信用声明规范"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"减排与抵消必须分开记账","id":"减排与抵消必须分开记账"},{"level":3,"text":"只有移除类才能中和残余排放","id":"只有移除类才能中和残余排放"},{"level":2,"text":"声明的允许边界","id":"声明的允许边界"},{"level":3,"text":"声明模板应作为可配置项","id":"声明模板应作为可配置项"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向逻辑：先问该不该抵消","id":"逆向逻辑-先问该不该抵消"},{"level":3,"text":"四步判定顺序","id":"四步判定顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"履约减排杠杆（模式/路由/包材）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/fulfillment-decarbon-lever"},"next":{"title":"碳足迹核算核查与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/carbon-footprint-audit-verify"}}